{%- doc -%}
  The MOMENTS logo for the gift-box lid (sections/hero-gift-box.liquid): the icon over the English wordmark, or over the Arabic
  wordmark on Arabic pages. Paths from the identity kit (01-Logo), fill currentColor so the lid sets the colour (white or nude).
  The paths are written ONCE as SVG symbols (part: 'defs', rendered at the top of the section, outside the 3D box, because a symbol
  inside a display:none face does not render everywhere); each logo on the lid is a small <use> reference, so the page carries one copy.
  Generated by scripts/prepare-hero-box.py; do not edit the paths by hand.

  @param {string} [part] - 'defs' outputs only the symbols (once per page); anything else outputs one logo.
{%- enddoc -%}
